# =============================================================================
#  MuxMaster (muxm) — .dockerignore
#
#  The image build only needs the `muxm` script itself (see `COPY muxm` in the
#  Dockerfile). Excluding everything else keeps the build context tiny even
#  when this folder also holds multi-gigabyte input/ and output/ media —
#  without this file, `docker compose build` would upload ALL of it to the
#  Docker daemon on every (re)build.
# =============================================================================
*
!muxm
